1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Your blinker flashing fast?

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,000
That's your car talking to you.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
A sudden double-speed click,

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
or a dash arrow blinking twice as fast as normal.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,800
One clue: a burned-out turn-signal bulb

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,000
changes the circuit — the relay speeds up to compensate.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
It's easy to miss from the driver's seat —

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
but other drivers can't see your turn at all.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Don't guess which bulb.

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
A quick check can spot it in minutes.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Worth checking before it becomes a ticket — or a close call.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look — Nick's Tire & Auto.
